* Adds the option to specify a help string for approve input

* Adds the option to specify example input with option descriptions of each input

* Adds the option to specify input shortcuts/substitutions (e.g. \"gt\" -> \"General Topics (A.1, B.2)\")

* If these options aren't specified, they are simply left out

In the .grapeconfig (the MR description is adding extra new lines):

'''

[review-dc-approve-inputs-guides]

source = prompt

prompt = Enter Guide(s):

default =

label = Guide(s)

help = Guide(s) used for Derivative Classifier review

examples = {\"C 2.4\": \"Some subject\", \"D 5.5\": \"Another subject\"}

substitutions = {\"General Topics\": \"General Topics (A 1.1, B 1.2)\", \"gt\": \"General Topics (A 1.1, B 1.2)\"}

required = True

cache = False

'''

Displayed to the user (the MR description is adding extra new lines):

'''

